      "text": "Shannon (1948): H(X) = -Σ p_i log p_i is the UNIQUE function satisfying continuity, symmetry, expansibility, maximum at uniform, and recursion/additivity (five axioms). Choosing log base 2 gives bits; base e gives nats."
